&=\frac{k^2-4k+4}{\sqrt{k^2-2k+4}}-\frac{k^2}{\sqrt{k^2-2k+4}}
&=\frac{4(1-k)}{\sqrt{k^2-2k+4}}  
\end{align*} Therefore,  $~~\boxed{\textbf{PQ}=\frac{4(1-k)}{\sqrt{k^2-2k+4}}}$ :)

