    &=\measuredangle FDC
    &=\measuredangle ADC
    &=\measuredangle CBA
    &=\measuredangle CBE
    &=\measuredangle BEC
    &=\measuredangle PEQ
.\end{align*}

This means that  $PFEQ$  is cyclic. So the problem reduces to proving that  $O_1C\perp PQ$ .

